    <div>
      <p begin="00:08.370" end="00:10.750" ttm:agent="v1">Yo bitch wanna fuck with the gang, I know</p>
      <p begin="00:10.750" end="00:12.900" ttm:agent="v1">Grippin' on the dick let her take my soul</p>
      <p begin="00:12.900" end="00:15.020" ttm:agent="v1">Me and all the homies on thot patrol</p>
      <p begin="00:15.020" end="00:17.460" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck her and her friend while we sit</p>
      <p begin="00:17.460" end="00:22.180" ttm:agent="v1">I like cars and she likes shoes, I like money and she does too</p>
      <p begin="00:22.180" end="00:24.350" ttm:agent="v1">I like the pills that can change my mood</p>
      <p begin="00:24.350" end="00:26.560" ttm:agent="v1">And when I'm with her I ain't ever gon' lose</p>
      <p begin="00:26.560" end="00:28.710" ttm:agent="v1">She's on neck and im on beans</p>
      <p begin="00:28.710" end="00:31.070" ttm:agent="v1">I love my girl, shes the one I need</p>
      <p begin="00:31.070" end="00:33.530" ttm:agent="v1">X and O's for all my hoes</p>
      <p begin="00:33.530" end="00:36.110" ttm:agent="v1">But I ain't got shit</p>
      <p begin="00:36.110" end="00:38.580" ttm:agent="v1">I be with the gang, we be ballin' like thе magic</p>
      <p begin="00:38.580" end="00:40.760" ttm:agent="v1">Addicted to the bread likе I'm a crack addict</p>
      <p begin="00:40.760" end="00:42.820" ttm:agent="v1">Walkin' like I'm static, peep my wrist got a Patek</p>
      <p begin="00:42.820" end="00:45.010" ttm:agent="v1">And my baby lookin' at it like, &quot;wait what&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:45.010" end="00:47.550" ttm:agent="v1">I don't got a Patek, I'm a menace with a skunk</p>
      <p begin="00:47.550" end="00:49.610" ttm:agent="v1">Don't be mad I got a zip and I ain't send my hunnid bucks</p>
      <p begin="00:49.610" end="00:51.980" ttm:agent="v1">Send a pack with the gas, putting blood on the blunt</p>
      <p begin="00:51.980" end="00:54.110" ttm:agent="v1">We are stinkin' up the whip like its a bum in the trunk</p>
      <p begin="00:54.110" end="00:56.460" ttm:agent="v1">I got gas and a leaf, I cut off the penjamin</p>
      <p begin="00:56.460" end="00:58.980" ttm:agent="v1">Spliff in my mouth, gonna pace him down again</p>
      <p begin="00:58.980" end="01:01.200" ttm:agent="v1">Glock with a beam so we dump 'em out</p>
      <p begin="01:01.200" end="01:03.580" ttm:agent="v1">His whole team getting sent if they fuck around again</p>
      <p begin="01:03.580" end="01:05.700" ttm:agent="v1">Bro gon fold the whip and push the pedal 'cause he fried</p>
      <p begin="01:05.700" end="01:08.240" ttm:agent="v1">Got a cig up in my mouth and hold the malware to the sky</p>
      <p begin="01:08.240" end="01:10.410" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga talkin' on the net so we gon' execute him live</p>
      <p begin="01:10.410" end="01:12.510" ttm:agent="v1">I don't even want his bitches, so just ask me for a ride</p>
      <p begin="01:12.510" end="01:14.490" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna leave you loafed</p>
      <p begin="01:14.490" end="01:16.700" ttm:agent="v1">Don't need hoes' cause the blunts give hugs</p>
      <p begin="01:16.700" end="01:18.860" ttm:agent="v1">Geeked than a bitch, loose leaf my skunk</p>
      <p begin="01:18.860" end="01:21.460" ttm:agent="v1">I need my gas, can't leave my plug</p>
      <p begin="01:21.460" end="01:23.650" ttm:agent="v1">Yo bitch wanna fuck with the gang, I know</p>
      <p begin="01:23.650" end="01:26.160" ttm:agent="v1">Grippin' on the dick let her take my soul</p>
      <p begin="01:26.160" end="01:28.490" ttm:agent="v1">Me and all the homies on thot patrol</p>
      <p begin="01:28.490" end="01:30.630" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck her and her friend while we sit</p>
      <p begin="01:30.630" end="01:35.030" ttm:agent="v1">I like cars and she likes shoes, I like money and she does too</p>
      <p begin="01:35.030" end="01:37.640" ttm:agent="v1">I like the pills that can change my mood</p>
      <p begin="01:37.640" end="01:39.780" ttm:agent="v1">And when I'm with her I ain't ever gon' lose</p>
      <p begin="01:39.780" end="01:41.740" ttm:agent="v1">She's on neck and im on beans</p>
      <p begin="01:41.740" end="01:44.310" ttm:agent="v1">I love my girl, shes the one I need</p>
